  "rawText": "Tomato Soup\n- 2 28 oz. cans crushed tomatoes\n- shit ton of garlic\n- 2 cups vegetable broth\n- 2 cups tomato juice\n- 3-4 slices sourdough bread\n- 1/2 cup milk\n- 1/2 cup plain full-fat Greek yogurt\n- 1/2 cup heavy cream\n- big handful of fresh basil leaves\n- whole thing of fresh dill\n- good squeeze of lemon juice\n- lemon zest\n(following are estimates use your hands and make them heaping)\n- 1/2 tsp. black pepper\n- 2 tsp. salt\n- 1/2 tsp. paprika\n- 1/2 tsp. onion powder\n- 1/2 tsp. dill\n- 1/2 tsp. seasoning salt\n- 1/2 tsp. thyme\n- 1 tsp. crushed red pepper\n- 1 tbsp. oregano\n- pinch of sugar\n\nThrow it in a pot. Simmer it on medium-low for a bit. Blend it up with an immersion blender until it's extremely smooth. Simmer on low with the lid on. 20-30 min is good. Longer the better.\n\nI make elite grilled cheese with that. Usually Gouda, sharp cheddar, sriracha, red wine vinegar caramelized onions, pepperoncinis, sourdough"
}
